# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks out CRLF while
# [tool.ruff.format] line-ending = "lf" demands LF, so `ruff format --check`
# fails locally and passes in Linux CI. NFR5 requires local Windows work to
# behave the same as the CI platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Diff fixtures are byte-exact inputs to the parser; never rewrite them.
tests/fixtures/patches/*.patch -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
